#: ../../source/index.rst:19
msgid ""
"clash_tools is a comprehensive collection of utilities for managing Clash"
" proxy configurations and services. It provides multiple command-line "
"tools for different purposes, making it easy to work with Clash in "
"various environments."
msgstr "clash_tools 是一个用于管理 Clash 代理配置和服务的综合工具集。它提供多种命令行工具用于不同用途，使得在各种环境中使用 Clash 变得简单。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:22
msgid "Tools Overview"
msgstr "工具概览"

#: ../../source/index.rst:24
#, fuzzy
msgid "The toolkit includes four main utilities:"
msgstr "该工具包包含四个主要工具："

#: ../../source/index.rst:26
msgid "**wireguard**"
msgstr "**wireguard**"

#: ../../source/index.rst:27
msgid "A tool to manage WireGuard server and client configurations."
msgstr "一个用于管理 WireGuard 服务端和客户端配置的工具。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:29
msgid "**clash_docker**"
msgstr "**clash_docker**"

#: ../../source/index.rst:30
msgid "Docker proxy management tool for enabling/disabling Docker proxy settings"
msgstr "用于启用/禁用 Docker 代理设置的 Docker 代理管理工具"

#: ../../source/index.rst:32
msgid "**clash_proxy**"
msgstr "**clash_proxy**"

#: ../../source/index.rst:33
msgid ""
"Shell script for setting up proxy environment variables in the current "
"session"
msgstr "用于在当前会话中设置代理环境变量的 shell 脚本"

#: ../../source/index.rst:35
msgid "**clash_serve**"
msgstr "**clash_serve**"

#: ../../source/index.rst:36
msgid ""
"Service management tool for starting the Clash service and managing "
"configuration files"
msgstr "用于启动 Clash 服务和管理配置文件的服务管理工具"

#: ../../source/index.rst:39
msgid "Features"
msgstr "特性"

#: ../../source/index.rst:41
msgid ""
"🚀 **Docker Integration**: One-click enable/disable Docker client and "
"daemon proxy"
msgstr "🚀 **Docker 集成**：一键启用/禁用 Docker 客户端和守护进程代理"

#: ../../source/index.rst:42
msgid "🔧 **Environment Setup**: Easy proxy environment variable configuration"
msgstr "🔧 **环境设置**：简单的代理环境变量配置"

#: ../../source/index.rst:43
msgid "🎯 **Service Management**: Simple Clash service startup and management"
msgstr "🎯 **服务管理**：简单的 Clash 服务启动和管理"

#: ../../source/index.rst:44
msgid "📊 **Status Monitoring**: Real-time proxy status checking"
msgstr "📊 **状态监控**：实时代理状态检查"

#: ../../source/index.rst:45
msgid "🔄 **Configuration Reset**: Convenient reset functionality"
msgstr "🔄 **配置重置**：便捷的重置功能"

#: ../../source/index.rst:46
msgid "💻 **Multi-platform**: Works on Linux systems with systemd support"
msgstr "💻 **多平台**：适用于支持 systemd 的 Linux 系统"

